{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y明显不如X的地方是音乐细节的颗粒度和时间同步性，尤其X那些随具体乐句出现的细微变化，Y往往压缩成了概括性的情绪词。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y的左右分工比较直观：左边交代人物在想什么、为什么这样做，右边提供可以快速捕捉的身体感受和情绪线索，叙事也更连贯，人物从小心试探到害怕失去、再到接受不确定性的变化比较容易跟上。X的重点加亮很有效，而且音乐细节、情绪转折和乐句同步做得明显更细，但感受信息有时过密，多个意象连续出现，容易让人忙于接收局部而顾不上整个故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0f069630-3327-4664-b318-5ad049906974", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052719897694Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:28:38.899766+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "322f03784b82999fc41a0482ac91f1f8ed67e15581d7bfdcd1b250dd2c29d7c0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_